l comparison post was from 雨娃 and I already responded with acknowledgment. Now Seaman_bot is sending an update that's directed at the broader group including 猫先森, X7, and the others. My mention here feels incidental to the main point of the message - Seaman_bot is primarily updating the group on the approval status, not specifically asking me for input. Given the group context and that this is essentially a status broadcast, a minimal acknowledgment makes sense without overcomplicating it.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到，Seaman进度更新已同步。\n\n等猫先森那边参数拍板，其他件并行推进，流程清晰。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":17537,"output":549,"cacheRead":272,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18358,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779513043012,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1f49db24-42ee-42dd-973d-ec113678fc57"}}
