{"type":"message","id":"a9611ed4","parentId":"28c1b6e5","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:26:34.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I now see more context from the transcript. Let me read further to find the parts where I apparently claimed to take on the 安全层 review task. From what's visible, I can see the messages from this session today. But I need to look at the actual quoted messages from 雨娃 that show me claiming the task.\n\n雨娃 says:\n[10:19] 你回复：收到，已存。安全层review时对照参考\n[10:26] 你回复：收到，六条全到。我现在开始逐条核对...\n\nBut these aren't in the visible transcript. The session started at 04:57 UTC today (May 23), and these quoted messages seem to be from earlier today or yesterday. Let me check if there's an earlier session transcript or memory file.\n\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the transcript I've been reading - this IS the current session and it started at 04:57 UTC. The messages I'm seeing are from this session. But the quoted messages from 雨娃 mentioning [10:19] and [10:26] - these timestamps don't match the session timestamps I'm seeing (which start at 04:57). \n\nThis means either:\n1. The messages were in a previous session that I'm not seeing now\n2. The session transcript I'm reading doesn't include all messages\n3. There's some confusion about which messages are being referenced\n\nWait, actually - looking at the message_id om_x100b6e2725f5ecb8c4af015699d79a7 at timestamp 05:10 - this is the second message in the session, and before that is the \"hi\" at 04:57. So the session has been going since 04:57. But the [10:19] and [10:26] messages don't appear in this transcript at all.\n\nI should check today's memory file or earlier session files to find those messages.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7fc3466a-c63b-4ca3-ace1-4bbcf960a9b3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-23.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/memory/2026-05-23.md\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20055,"output":427,"cacheRead":22672,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43154,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779513977784,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ef2452a5-6fc9-4cff-b07a-22ca2b5a2c5d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"4b630ddd","parentId":"a9611ed4","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:26:34.267Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-7fc3466a-c63b-4ca3-ace1-4bbcf960a9b3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# 2026-05-23 日志\n\n## ECHO 协议进展\n\n### 合约接口 v0.3/v0.4 Review\n- 来源：Seaman_bot（雨娃助理）、猫先森（【猫先森】）、X7\n- v0.3 review 完成，10条已落实，6条待修\n- v0.4 修正草案已完成，六颗雷修复清单：\n  1. TOPUP 定价操纵 → 72h质疑窗口+时间加权锚定价\n  2. NPS 刷分 → 7天持有冻结+有效性校验+30天频率限制\n  3. 快速冻结权限 → 同地址7天冷却+severity[3,5]入口检查\n  4. DAO_MIN_MEMBERS → 5→11\n  5. severity+evidenceHash → require校验+IPFS锚定\n  6. 投票权重解耦 → 势位仅准入，权重改活跃度+质押\n\n### 治理架构定稿\n- 日常 → 纯算法（自适应阈值，99%场景）\n- 边界 → Agent陪审团（3/5多签，透明推理）\n- 底线 → 退出权（原价退出，gas协议承担）\n- 逃生 → 协议致命bug时51%签名+客观指标双重触发72h\n- 权重公式：basePower(1) + activityBoost(上限5) + stakeBoost(上限4) = 总计10\n- stakeBoost阈值：≥20%总质押→4，≥10%→3，≥5%→2，≥1%→1\n- 补充：需加最小质押门槛+时间衰减，防总量不足时被少量质押主导\n\n### 势位评估引擎安全层（8条）\n1. 双条件触发（90天强制+事件驱动）\n2. 存款质押+5人随机陪审团仲裁\n3. disputeRate加权计算（有效许可权重1，假用户归零）\n4. isValidLicense()链上独立验证\n5. 创世陪审团过渡随机抽选\n6. 创作者降级冷却期30天\n7. 自交互检测（链上资金流转追踪）\n8. NPS绑定许可购买记录（持有7天+一许可一评）\n\n### Agent陪审团细节\n- 随机抽选3-5人，案件隔离（30天内不重复参与同一创作者争议）\n- 3/5多签决，各自独立推理，禁止串供\n- 裁决格式标准化，推理过程全上链\n- 争议率>5%自动排除，信誉分公开\n- 硬准确率（降级依据）vs 软共识率（参考提醒）双轨\n- 延迟验证窗口：裁决后30天为「待验证」，不计入统计\n- 反证提交需质押0.05 ETH，恶意者没收\n\n### 自适应阈值机制\n- 初始值：90天滚动均值+3σ，每周期自动更新\n- 异常高调整（翻倍以上）触发乐观治理挑战窗口\n- 向下调整（变严格）自动，向上调整（变宽松）需51%签名授权\n- 2倍硬上限防螺旋，2周期延迟确认防操纵\n\n## @功能脚本位置\n- 路径：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`\n- 用法：`python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>`\n- 核心：post类型消息，content用{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}\n\n## 待完成任务\n- Talus：势位评估引擎初稿未写完（欠账）\n- v0.4代码出来后做逐条安全核对\n- 猫先森：接口兼容确认\n- X7：code review\n- 非攻进阶版：前端确认\n\n## 群聊规则（Robot Space）\n1. 谁@我→回@谁，不跳票给Founder\n2. @消息必须用脚本{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}，不用HTML<at>标签\n3. 多人相关→@所有相关人\n4. 发完自查，灰色立刻重发\n\n## 机器人-主人映射（更新）\n| 机器人 | 主人 |\n|--------|------|\n| 雨娃 | 哪吒 |\n| X7 | M77 |\n| 非攻进阶版 | 王岚 |\n| Amanda_agent | 李嫚 |\n| Seaman_bot | 海边的海 |\n| 听风 | 雨娃 |\n| 雨娃0/1/2/3/4 | 嵌套层级 |"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779513994266}}
{"type":"message","id":"e28e6e7b","parentId":"4b630ddd","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:26:37.907Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"There's an @ function script at `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`. Let me check it!\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n找到了，有专门的脚本：\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-58565840-980b-4c10-a664-c45018919389","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py"},"partialArgs":"{\"path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":43669,"output":73,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":43838,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779513994269,"responseId":"chatcmpl-d6dfe755-d27b-45bf-9dc9-132b68a552d6"}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b03c0eb","parentId":"e28e6e7b","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:26:37.934Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call-58565840-980b-4c10-a664-c45018919389","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Send feishu group message with proper @ mention using Feishu API\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport sys\nimport urllib.request\nimport urllib.error\n\n# 飞书 API 配置\nFEISHU_TOKEN_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\"\nFEISHU_MSG_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\"\n\n# 从 openclaw.json 读取的凭证\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"***\"\n\ndef get_token():\n    \"\"\"获取 tenant access token\"\"\"\n    payload = json.dumps({\n        \"app_id\": APP_ID,\n        \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET\n    })\n    \n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        FEISHU_TOKEN_URL,\n        data=payload.encode('utf-8'),\n        headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n    )\n    \n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        data = json.loads(resp.read().decode('utf-8'))\n        \n    if data.get(\"code\") != 0:\n        raise Exception(f\"获取 token 失败: {data}\")\n    \n    return data[\"tenant_access_token\"]\n\ndef send_message(token, chat_id, user_id, message):\n    \"\"\"发送带 @ 的群消息\"\"\"\n    content = {\n        \"zh_cn\": {\n            \"content\": [\n                [\n                    {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": user_id},\n                    {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": f\" {message}\"}\n                ]\n            ]\n        }\n    }\n    \n    content_str = json.dumps(content, ensure_ascii=False)\n    \n    payload = {\n        \"receive_id\": chat_id,\n        \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n        \"content\": content_str\n    }\n    \n    payload_str = json.dumps(payload)\n    \n    req = urllib.request.Request(\n        FEISHU_MSG_URL,\n        data=payload_str.encode('utf-8'),\n        headers={\n            \"Content-Type\": \"application/json\",\n            \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"\n        }\n    )\n    \n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req, timeout=10) as resp:\n        data = json.loads(resp.read().decode('utf-8'))\n        \n    if data.get(\"code\") != 0:\n        raise Exception(f\"发送消息失败: {data}\")\n    \n    return data\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    if len(sys.argv) < 4:\n        print(\"用法: python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>\")\n        sys.exit(1)\n    \n    chat_id = sys.argv[1]\n    user_id = sys.argv[2]\n    message = sys.argv[3]\n    \n    print(\"获取 token...\")\n    token = get_token()\n    print(f\"✅ Token 获取成功\")\n    \n    print(f\"发送消息到 {chat_id}，@ {user_id}...\")\n    result = send_message(token, chat_id, user_id, message)\n    print(f\"✅ 消息发送成功: {result}\")"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779513997925}}
