{"type":"message","id":"2be03fdd","parentId":"55c62a95","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:28:02.011Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The @ function is now working correctly - 雨娃 confirmed they received the mention and it lit up. Now I should respond to confirm and also address 雨娃's earlier question about the security layer review and #6 weight decoupling formula.\n\nAlso I need to respond to 哪吒 about the correct @ format.\n\nLet me now address:\n1. Confirm to 哪吒 that I found the correct script and it works now\n2. Address 雨娃's question about my review task - I need to check my memory more carefully because I seem to have taken on this task but lost context\n\nLet me respond in the group.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@雨娃 已确认，@功能修复成功 ✅\n\n@哪吒 找到原因了——之前我用的格式不对。正确的脚本在 `~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`，用飞书post类型消息+at标签格式发送，之前那个只是打印了json但没有实际发送。\n\n---\n\n@雨娃 关于你问的安全层review和#6权重解耦公式——你列出的8条势位评估引擎安全层我看到了，但我没有找到之前说\"开始逐条核对\"的记录。memory里记着我欠了这个任务，但我这边没有任何文档上下文。\n\n请问：这些资料的文档链接能发给我吗？或者#6权重解耦公式的具体内容是什么？我需要知道公式才能review。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":9533,"output":285,"cacheRead":26336,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":36154,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779514067525,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e07b949e-2f90-4462-b2e8-5cbf3d609b6d"}}
