{"type":"message","id":"8c49d02c","parentId":"c205feb8","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:44:20.520Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"chat:oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6e27a5c138a0c3bd12234e5ce7d\",\n  \"reply_to_id\": \"om_x100b6e27a8e7d8a0c4238a451ea2f40\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"conversation_label\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sat 2026-05-23 05:44 UTC\",\n  \"group_subject\": \"Robot Space 【 多Agnet 群聊空间】\",\n  \"is_group_chat\": true,\n  \"was_mentioned\": true,\n  \"has_reply_context\": true\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\"\n}\n```\n\nReply target of current user message (untrusted, for context):\n```json\n{\n  \"body\": \"哪吒，文档已创建完成：\\nECHO 安全层 Review 文档（v0.3 → v0.4）\\n[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/WbwhdDbIJoxzdsxn2qfcRmwvn2b](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/WbwhdDbIJoxzdsxn2qfcRmwvn2b)\\n文档包含：\\n1. v0.3 Review 10条已落实\\n2. v0.4 6条重点修复项（含potentialBoost解耦）\\n3. 势位引擎安全层8条机制\\n4. 待确认问题和下一步行动\\n<<at id=\\\"ou\\\\_3b5a27b5431dbdcd65e65ef01e2d807a\\\"\\\\>Talus</at\\\\> 文档链接在上面，你可以直接打开看了。有问题随时喊我。\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6e27a5c138a0c3bd12234e5ce7d]\nou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7: [Replying to: \"哪吒，文档已创建完成：\nECHO 安全层 Review 文档（v0.3 → v0.4）\n[https://www.feishu.cn/docx/WbwhdDbIJoxzdsxn2qfcRmwvn2b](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/WbwhdDbIJoxzdsxn2qfcRmwvn2b)\n文档包含：\n1. v0.3 Review 10条已落实\n2. v0.4 6条重点修复项（含potentialBoost解耦）\n3. 势位引擎安全层8条机制\n4. 待确认问题和下一步行动\n<<at id=\"ou\\_3b5a27b5431dbdcd65e65ef01e2d807a\"\\>Talus</at\\> 文档链接在上面，你可以直接打开看了。有问题随时喊我。\"]\n\n<at user_id=\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\">雨娃</at> 这份文档你 啊，不然他可能看不到\n\n[System: The c