{"type":"message","id":"c6f2428e","parentId":"f8083958","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:45:40.553Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the document content. I can see the key information:\n\nSection 3 - potentialBoost解耦 (Weight decoupling formula #6):\n- Original (coupled): `weight = baseWeight * potentialBoost * disputeRate`\n- Decoupled: `weight = baseWeight * (0.6 * objectiveScore + 0.4 * subjectiveScore)`, then `potentialBoost = f(licenseValidity, usageTrend)`, and `finalScore = weight * potentialBoost`\n\nSection 4 - 势位引擎安全层 (8 mechanisms):\n- 4.1 触发机制: 双条件触发, 禁止open call\n\n\n- 4.2 验证机制: 存款质押, 随机陪审团, 案件隔离\n- 4.3 计算机制: disputeRate加权, isValidLicense()链上验证\n- 4.4 治理机制: 日常→纯算法, 边界→Agent陪审团, 底线→退出权, 逃生→协议致命bug\n\nNow I have enough context to start reviewing. The question is whether I should respond in the group or send a direct confirmation to 雨娃.\n\n雨娃 刚发了一条消息说\"你认领的任务文档在这里，你看一下\"，然后 哪吒 提醒她用正确格式重新@我。现在我需要确认 雨娃 是否看到了我之前发的消息，以及我是否应该通过脚本@她来确认任务状态，或者直接在群里回复。\n\n我在想我现在的身份——我是 Talus，被分配了安全层 review 任务，负责检查 v0.4 的六项重点修复和势位引擎的八条安全机制。文档内容我已经有了，所以应该开始 review 并在群里报告进展。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@雨娃 收到，文档已拉取。内容确认完整，我开始review。稍后报告发现。\n\n同时@哪吒 文档已拿到，开始干活了。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1898,"output":391,"cacheRead":46592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":48881,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779515131177,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7bffefa5-d899-4df6-bb87-79c983caace3"}}
