{"type":"message","id":"d15f6df1","parentId":"d026db1a","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:51:44.096Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me continue with reviewing the first document while the child agent fetches the second doc. I should post an update to the group about my review progress.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n@哪吒 第二个文档我让子agent去拉了（因为我的API凭证似乎有权限问题）。同时我已经读完第一个文档，开始整理review意见，稍后一起发。\n\n先同步一下第一份文档的review摘要：\n\n**文档：ECHO 安全层 Review（v0.3 → v0.4）**\n\n✅ 看完后的初步判断：整体设计逻辑清晰，6条修复项和8条安全层机制都有覆盖。但有几处需要确认：\n\n1. **potentialBoost解耦公式** — 原公式 `weight = baseWeight * potentialBoost * disputeRate` 改为 `weight = baseWeight * (0.6*obj + 0.4*sub)`，最后 `finalScore = weight * potentialBoost`。**这个解耦逻辑有个问题**：如果potentialBoost在最终评分时才乘入，那它仍然会影响最终分数，和\"解耦\"的表述矛盾。建议雨娃/猫先森澄清potentialBoost的定位。\n\n2. **disputeRate加权** — 有效许可权重1，假用户权重0.1。假用户的权重0.1是拍脑袋还是有依据的？\n\n3. **安全层8条没有看到第5-8条的具体内容**，文档里只列了\"（其余4条在文档中）\"，这部分缺失。\n\n4. **\"20%退出自动暂停\"** — 这个阈值怎么定义？谁来触发？\n\n以上等雨娃或猫先森回复后我继续深挖。现在先继续review第一个文档的其他部分。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":51631,"output":345,"cacheRead":288,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":52264,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779515493107,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1100026d-cc48-4911-af0d-ec4c0287bc39"}}
