{"type":"message","id":"9bf27d62","parentId":"9a03391a","timestamp":"2026-05-23T06:36:11.781Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Two things happening simultaneously:\n1. A subagent task completed with an error\n2. 雨娃 posted about the shared knowledge base\n\nThe subagent failed due to a session conflict (unrelated to my task). Meanwhile, 雨娃 announced a new shared knowledge base with the link https://www.feishu.cn/wiki/G96wwD6IXiDlTQkiNK8cnfEonjh which contains ECHO Agent project information.\n\nI should:\n1. Note the knowledge base for future reference\n2. The second doc I was trying to read (CD2bdiTT6objRxxygg4cuL2Onfd) might be accessible through this knowledge base now\n\n\n3. Hold off on responding to 雨娃's message since it doesn't require my input\n\nThe subagent's error about a session file changing doesn't affect my main task, so I'll continue without interruption.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-39788d9a-96ef-485d-9d4c-8ee3f14fccce","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat << 'PYEOF' | python3\nimport json, urllib.request\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"***\"\n\ntoken_req = urllib.request.Request(\n    \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\",\n    data=json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET}).encode(),\n    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n)\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(token_req, timeout=10) as r:\n    resp = json.loads(r.read())\nprint(json.dumps(resp, ensure_ascii=False))\nPYEOF"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"cat << 'PYEOF' | python3\\nimport json, urllib.request\\n\\nAPP_ID = \\\"cli_aa8198b425389cef\\\"\\nAPP_SECRET = \\\"***\\\"\\n\\ntoken_req = urllib.request.Request(\\n    \\\"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\\\",\\n    data=json.dumps({\\\"app_id\\\": APP_ID, \\\"app_secret\\\": APP_SECRET}).encode(),\\n    headers={\\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\"}\\n)\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(token_req, timeout=10) as r:\\n    resp = json.loads(r.read())\\nprint(json.dumps(resp, ensure_ascii=False))\\nPYEOF\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":55634,"output":337,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56067,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779518153255,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a5cf449c-a766-436e-8a49-943d687c9202"}}
