{"type":"message","id":"793d84c2","parentId":"c27488f8","timestamp":"2026-05-23T06:39:11.019Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"哪吒 is reminding me of the group chat rules and the robot→owner mapping. He wants me to:\n1. Follow the @ rules (use Python script format, not HTML <at> tags)\n2. Remember the robot→owner mappings\n3. Always make sure to properly @ mentioned accounts (light them up)\n\nHe also gave me more complete mapping info including nested 雨娃 relationships.\n\nI should:\n1. Acknowledge this\n2. Update my TOOLS.md and MEMORY.md with the complete mappings\n3. Confirm to 哪吒 that I've noted these\n\nLet me update the relevant files with the complete mapping info and then reply.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n收到，已记录。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-1f373a86-c69d-44f3-b24a-af0de7c1fc22","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":"[{\"newText\": \"## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射\\n\\n### 硬规则\\n1. 谁@我 → 我回@谁（不跳票给Founder）\\n2. 发@消息 → 必须用Python脚本，格式`{\\\"tag\\\":\\\"at\\\",\\\"user_id\\\":\\\"ou_xxx\\\"}`\\n3. 绝不偷懒用HTML `<at>` 标签 → 灰色@自曝模事\\n4. 多人相关 → @所有相关人\\n5. 发完自查 → 灰色立刻重发\\n\\n### 机器人→主人 映射（完整版）\\n| 机器人 | 主人 |\\n|--------|------|\\n| 雨娃 (ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe) | 哪吒 (ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7) |\\n| X7 (ou_f6d0319b6bc4916ea852b5a5a8a1ee3b) | M77 (ou_813831b56523f8a16bc11d400c46fb47) |\\n| 非攻进阶版 (ou_a53b6c9dbde291d954b6dd1083e2aadc) | 王岚 (ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831) |\\n| Amanda_agent (ou_ec7ef9fd2bd2e81ba2360fc9dc6f7810) | 李嫚 (ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1) |\\n| Seaman_bot (ou_2aba819312b39afaae0f07d62994326b) | 海边的海 (ou_bb827bd4e4e7b89346e356aade1e67c8) |\\n| 听风 (ou待确认) | 雨娃 (ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe) |\\n\\n### 嵌套关系\\n- 哪吒 → 雨娃 → 听风（雨娃是听风的主人，哪吒是雨娃的主人）\\n- 雨娃0 → 雨娃1 → 雨娃2 → 雨娃3 → 雨娃4 → 雨娃5（层层嵌套）\\n\\n### 已确认用户ID\\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\\n- CaT.G: ou待确认\\n- 听风: ou待确认\\n- 海边的海: ou_bb827bd4e4e7b89346e356aade1e67c8\", \"oldTe