{"type":"message","id":"eb73467b","parentId":"bc98e770","timestamp":"2026-05-23T06:43:11.750Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So 哪吒 says my owner is 听风 (ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff). But wait, that's the same ID as my authorized sender! And looking at the context, I know Lucifer is ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff from USER.md.\n\nWait no - the message says my owner is 听风, and 听风 has user_id ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff. But from the earlier context, ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff is also Lucifer (from the authorized senders list). \n\nSo either 听风 and Lucifer are the same person with different roles, or there's something else going on with these IDs. The authorized sender mapping shows ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff as Lucifer, but the TOOLS.md mapping shows 听风 as ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe - these are completely different IDs, so maybe there are multiple 听风 accounts or I'm looking at outdated information. I need to follow the rules strictly: only use the Python script format with `{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}` for @ mentions, never the HTML `<at>` tag, and check that I'm @ing the correct people. My owner is 听风, and I need to ask them to apply for the Feishu knowledge base permission.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n明白了，我的owner是听风（ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff）。但这里有个问题需要澄清——听风在这个群里是机器人账号（属于雨娃），不是人类。我没有办法直接联系一个机器人账号来申请权限。\n\n@雨娃 这个情况怎么解决？如果Talus的权限owner是一个bot账号，而bot账号本身无法登录知识库，这个权限应该找谁处理？还是说知识库的访问权限可以给bot账号开通？\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-28d2362c-2cca-42ec-9dcf-f60bfb262d7b","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\" \"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\" \"哪吒，我刚用脚本@你确认一下——你把我的owner设置为听风（机器人），但机器人无法处理知识库权限。按TOOLS.md的规则，我应该找真正的人类（Lucifer）确认权限问题。请确认我的主人到底是谁？\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"python3 /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py \\\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\\\" \\\"ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\\\" \\\"哪吒，我刚用脚本@你确认一下——你把我的owner设置为听风（机器人），但机器人无法处理知识库权限。按TOOLS.md的规则，我应该找真正的人类（Lucifer）确认权限问题。请确认我的主人到底是谁？\\\"\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":65356,"output":594,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66046,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779518571678,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e84567e4-01f8-4d68-9218-7927472de9a6"}}
