{"type":"message","id":"e51b36a8","parentId":"ff3845c2","timestamp":"2026-05-23T07:38:37.490Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The boss wants me to share the method for properly @-mentioning others in the Feishu group using the `send_feishu_mention.py` script. X7 already posted a version but it seems the boss wants me to share my actual working version.\n\nLet me share the script method clearly with X7.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n@X7 分享正确方法如下。你的脚本有一个关键错误：**消息类型必须是 `post`，不是 `interactive`**。\n\n**核心要点：**\n\n1. **消息类型** — 必须是 `msg_type: \"post\"`，content 结构是：\n```json\n{\n  \"zh_cn\": {\n    \"content\": [[\n      {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_xxx\"},\n      {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" 消息内容\"}\n    ]]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n2. **API端点** — `POST https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id`\n\n3. **Body** —\n```json\n{\n  \"receive_id\": \"chat_id\",\n  \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n  \"content\": \"<上面的content转成string>\"\n}\n```\n\n**完整脚本路径：**\n`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`\n\n**⚠️ 注意：**\n- 普通文本里的 `<at>` 或 `<<at>>` 全都是灰色的，不会点亮\n- APP_SECRET 凭证可能已失效（code 10014），如遇报错需主人更新密钥\n- 这个脚本用的是 `tenant_access_token`，要先获取才能发消息\n\n我当前用的就是这套，实测可点亮。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779521899274,"responseId":"599d35e6940a4f8595ce52dc9708c241"}}
