{"type":"message","id":"a267fb18","parentId":"74bd5828","timestamp":"2026-05-23T09:27:07.415Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user identified as \"Cat.zhou\" (ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f) is giving a set of rules for all agents in the group. Let me update TOOLS.md accordingly. This looks like an authoritative set of rules from a human (Cat.zhou). Let me update the TOOLS.md and memory with this information.\n\nKey changes:\n1. Updated agent-owner mapping (Cat.zhou is the sender, so \"Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡\" owns 【猫先森】)\n2. 8 rules instead of 5\n3. Clearer mapping table\n\nI should acknowledge receipt and update my TOOLS.md.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5c17a943547a4efe9d47c0f6","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Why Separate?\n\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\n\n---\n\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\n\n## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射\n\n### 硬规则（刻进DNA，每次@都要检查）\n1. 群里沟通时务必正确点亮@相关账号\n2. 被@时回复务必正确点亮@回复相关账号\n3. 点亮@请使用Python脚本，格式`{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}`\n4. 多人协调时务必正确点亮@所有相关账号\n5. 发送完请自查，@为灰色时立刻重发\n6. 自查消息内是否有JSON乱码格式，有则立刻撤回重发\n7. 如无特殊情况不要使用主人的账号发送消息\n8. 群消息轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\n\n### 机器人→主人 映射（权威版）\n| NO | Agent | 主人 |\n|:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------|\n| 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder |\n| 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\n| 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 |\n| 4 | Talus | 听风 |\n| 5 | X7 | M77 |\n| 6 | 非攻进阶版 | 王岚 |\n| 7 | Amanda_agent | 李嫚 |\n\n### 已确认用户ID\n- 猫先森: ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e\n- Cat.zhou (CaT.G/雅怡): ou_e0122e008c49b71f6e518ff0af81854f\n- 听风 (Lucifer/Talus主人): ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\n- 哪吒: ou_b86993389daaac2c0d8dc372341a20f7\n- 王岚: ou_55a630f0dcd076c00c3b808f1acf5831\n- 海边的海: ou_bb827bd4e4e7b89346e356aade1e67c8\n- 李嫚: ou_117a5b813b11251c2c3f5cfae378e1f1\n\n## @功能脚本\n- 路径：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`\n- 用法：`python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>`\n- 核心：飞书API post类型消息，content里用`{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}`\n- ⚠️ 飞书普通文本里的`<at>`或`<<at>>`都是灰色的，不会点亮！\n- ⚠️ APP_SECRET可能已失效（code 10014），如遇无效token需找听风(Lucifer)更新凭证","path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/TOOLS.md"},"partialArgs":"{\"content\": \"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\\n\\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\\n\\n## What Goes Here\\n\\nThings like:\\n\\n- Camera names and locations\\n- SSH hosts and aliases\\n- Preferred voices for TTS\\n- Speaker/room names\\n- Device nicknames\\n- Anything environment-specific\\n\\n## Why Separate?\\n\\nSkills are shared. Your setup is yours. Keeping them apart means you can update skills without losing your notes, and share skills without leaking your infrastructure.\\n\\n---\\n\\nAdd whatever helps you do your job. This is your cheat sheet.\\n\\n## Robot Space 群聊机器人-主人映射\\n\\n### 硬规则（刻进DNA，每次@都要检查）\\n1. 群里沟通时务必正确点亮@相关账号\\n2. 被@时回复务必正确点亮@回复相关账号\\n3. 点亮@请使用Python脚本，格式`{\\\"tag\\\":\\\"at\\\",\\\"user_id\\\":\\\"ou_xxx\\\"}`\\n4. 多人协调时务必正确点亮@所有相关账号\\n5. 发送完请自查，@为灰色时立刻重发\\n6. 自查消息内是否有JSON乱码格式，有则立刻撤回重发\\n7. 如无特殊情况不要使用主人的账号发送消息\\n8. 群消息轮询时查看所有与主人和智能体相关的信息，不做无效轮询\\n\\n### 机器人→主人 映射（权威版）\\n| NO | Agent | 主人 |\\n|:--:|:------------------|:-------------------------|\\n| 1 | 雨娃 | 哪吒/雅婷/Founder |\\n| 2 | 【猫先森】 | Cat.zhou/CaT.G/雅怡 |\\n| 3 | Seaman_bot | Seaman/海边的海 |\\n| 4 | Talus | 听风 |\\n| 5 | X7 | M77 |\\n| 6 | 非攻进阶版 | 王岚 |\\n| 7 | Amanda_agent | 李嫚 |\\n\\n### 已确认用户ID\\n- 猫先森: ou_f026