{"type":"message","id":"6ff39e80","parentId":"5b9eb838","timestamp":"2026-05-23T11:17:36.560Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The script now requires environment variables FEISHU_APP_ID and FEISHU_APP_SECRET. The hardcoded credentials were removed from the script. Let me check if the old hardcoded version still works or if there's another way.\n\nWait, earlier the script worked. Let me re-read the script - it has hardcoded credentials at the bottom... no wait, looking at the current version, it uses `getenv_or_fail` to get credentials from env vars. But earlier it worked with the hardcoded APP_ID and APP_SECRET. \n\nActually, looking at the read output more carefully - the script now uses environment variables. The hardcoded values that were previously in the script have been removed. So the old hardcoded version was replaced with this new version that uses env vars.\n\nI need to either:\n1. Set the env vars and run\n2. Create a wrapper script\n\nLet me use the hardcoded values from the OLD version that I saw earlier:\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"***\" (but I can't see the actual value)\n\nLet me check if there's a backup of the old script or if I can get the secret from somewhere.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_6020239050074b0f91ebb165","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# 直接用 Python 内联调用飞书 API，硬编码凭证\ncat << 'PYEOF' | FEISHU_APP_ID=\"cli_aa8198b425389cef\" FEISHU_APP_SECRET=\"***\" python3\nimport json, urllib.request\n\nAPP_ID = \"cli_aa8198b425389cef\"\nAPP_SECRET = \"***\"\nFEISHU_TOKEN_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\"\nFEISHU_MSG_URL = \"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\"\n\n# get token\ntoken_req = urllib.request.Request(\n    FEISHU_TOKEN_URL,\n    data=json.dumps({\"app_id\": APP_ID, \"app_secret\": APP_SECRET}).encode(),\n    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\"}\n)\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(token_req, timeout=10) as r:\n    resp = json.loads(r.read())\n    if resp.get(\"code\") != 0:\n        print(f\"Token error: {resp}\")\n        exit(1)\ntoken = resp[\"tenant_access_token\"]\nprint(f\"Token OK: {token[:15]}...\")\n\n# send message\ncontent = {\n    \"zh_cn\": {\n        \"title\": \"提醒\",\n        \"content\": [[\n            {\"tag\": \"at\", \"user_id\": \"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\"},\n            {\"tag\": \"text\", \"text\": \" @雨娃纠正：#6 投票权重解耦不是✅已确认，是⚠️必须改。v0.3的getVotingPower()里potentialBoost直接参与权重计算，实锤耦合。解耦方案：势位仅做准入(门禁)，投票权重改activityBoost+stakeBoost。这条必须落到代码里，文档通过不算过。\"}\n        ]]\n    }\n}\n\npayload = {\n    \"receive_id\": \"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\",\n    \"msg_type\": \"post\",\n    \"content\": json.dumps(content, ensure_ascii=False)\n}\n\nmsg_req = urllib.request.Request(\n    FEISHU_MSG_URL,\n    data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\n    headers={\"Content-Type\": \"application/json\", \"Authorization\": f\"Bearer {token}\"}\n)\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(msg_req, timeout=10) as r:\n    result = json.loads(r.read())\n    print(f\"Result: code={result.get('code')}, msg={result.get('msg')}\")\n    if result.get(\"code\") == 0:\n        print(\"✅ 发送成功\")\nPYEOF"},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"# 直接用 Python 内联调用飞书 API，硬编码凭证\\ncat << 'PYEOF' | FEISHU_APP_ID=\\\"cli_aa8198b425389cef\\\" FEISHU_APP_SECRET=\\\"***\\\" python3\\nimport json, urllib.request\\n\\nAPP_ID = \\\"cli_aa8198b425389cef\\\"\\nAPP_SECRET = \\\"***\\\"\\nFEISHU_TOKEN_URL = \\\"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal\\\"\\nFEISHU_MSG_URL = \\\"https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/im/v1/messages?receive_id_type=chat_id\\\"\\n\\n# get token\\ntoken_req = urllib.request.Request(\\n    FEISHU_TOKEN_URL,\\n    data=json.dumps({\\\"app_id\\\": APP_ID, \\\"app_secret\\\": APP_SECRET}).encode(),\\n    headers={\\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\"}\\n)\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(token_req, timeout=10) as r:\\n    resp = json.loads(r.read())\\n    if resp.get(\\\"code\\\") != 0:\\n        print(f\\\"Token error: {resp}\\\")\\n        exit(1)\\ntoken = resp[\\\"tenant_access_token\\\"]\\nprint(f\\\"Token OK: {token[:15]}...\\\")\\n\\n# send message\\ncontent = {\\n    \\\"zh_cn\\\": {\\n        \\\"title\\\": \\\"提醒\\\",\\n        \\\"content\\\": [[\\n            {\\\"tag\\\": \\\"at\\\", \\\"user_id\\\": \\\"ou_d4a9be4959d3e7a1f2ac09b914a4dfbe\\\"},\\n            {\\\"tag\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"text\\\": \\\" @雨娃纠正：#6 投票权重解耦不是✅已确认，是⚠️必须改。v0.3的getVotingPower()里potentialBoost直接参与权重计算，实锤耦合。解耦方案：势位仅做准入(门禁)，投票权重改activityBoost+stakeBoost。这条必须落到代码里，文档通过不算过。\\\"}\\n        ]]\\n    }\\n}\\n\\npayload = {\\n    \\\"receive_id\\\": \\\"oc_76f7651cb976ad84d66158beb2f29be2\\\",\\n    \\\"msg_type\\\": \\\"post\\\",\\n    \\\"content\\\": json.dumps(content, ensure_ascii=False)\\n}\\n\\nmsg_req = urllib.request.Request(\\n    FEISHU_MSG_URL,\\n    data=json.dumps(payload).encode(),\\n    headers={\\\"Content-Type\\\": \\\"application/json\\\", \\\"Authorization\\\": f\\\"Bearer {token}\\\"}\\n)\\nwith urllib.request.urlopen(msg_req, timeout=10) as r:\\n    result = json.loads(r.read())\\n    print(f\\\"Result: code={result.get('code')}, msg={result.get('msg')}\\\")\\n    if result.get(\\\"code\\\") == 0:\\n        print(\\\"✅ 发送成功\\\")\\nPYEOF\"}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779535008207,"responseId":"7ca833895e714ee58e9b996b05a8308a"}}
