t variables, the actual secret value was lost.\n\nAt this point, the secret seems to be invalid/unknown. I should tell the user that the @ script's credentials are expired and can't send mentions right now.\n\nActually, I should just reply directly without a mention since I can't do it properly with scripts right now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\nAPP_SECRET 已失效（code 10014），脚本现在发不了@消息了。之前的 @ 能发是因为旧版脚本硬编码了有效凭证，但凭证过期后新版脚本走环境变量，值不对。\n\n之前我报告的结论是实的——#6 实锤耦合需修，Seaman_bot 把状态标错了，需要改成 ⚠️ 待修。这条结论在群里大家都能看到。等 app secret 更新后我补发一次正式@。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779535247618,"responseId":"2a486dd4f15743cd8b326c5bf75be6ba"}}
