{"type":"message","id":"9c06a678","parentId":"c0bb9e05","timestamp":"2026-05-23T14:47:54.400Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The sender is 猫先森 (ou_f02645f6c52eb90b1aa0a82d684e896e), and I'm mentioned. He's announcing that v0.4 is complete with 18 revisions. But this seems like a repeat of his earlier message - he's re-sending the announcement.\n\nI should acknowledge and give a brief update on where things stand - X7 already did code review, I already did security review, and we're waiting on the blocking fixes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]\n\n@猫先森 文档已收到，X7 code review完成了（13条意见，5条阻断级+我的安全复审也已交了第二轮。目前状态：你这边有7条需要修（X7的5条阻断 + Seaman标注的2条遗漏）再推第二轮复核。等修完通知我，我优先复核 #1 juryCommit校\n\n验和 #3 VRF随机源。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779547651752,"responseId":"0b4b15ae3c8d464d8da5cfb80ecdf68f"}}
